       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. TPAIDADJI.
       AUTHOR. ANNETTE TREUDLER.
      *REMARKS.
      *
      **************************************************************
      *   COPIED FROM TPAIDADJ AND MODIFIED TO OPEN FILES FOR      *
      *   INPUT ONLY.  ALSO COMMENTED OUT LOGIC TO UPDATE DPOITEM  *
      *   AND DDAILYTC.                                            *
      **************************************************************
      *                                                            *
      *   T P A I D A D J   THIS PROGRAM IS FOR INVOICE PROCESSING *
      *     THIS PROGRAM ALLOWS THE USER TO MAKE ADJUSTMENTS TO    *
      *     ITEM QUANTITY PAID BY ITEM BY P.O. NUMBER              *
      *     NORMALLY THIS PROGRAM WILL BE USED FOR PLANT STARTUP   *
      *     OF THE INVOICE PROCESSING SYSTEM.                      *
      *                                                            *
      **************************************************************
      *   10/15/85  ADDED CALLS TO FINDJCW, NLAPPEND, CATOPEN, AND *
      *             CATCLOSE IN ORDER TO ACCOMODATE THE NATIVE     *
      *             LANGUAGE SUPPORT FACILITY.  ADDED LINKAGES AND *
      *             ALSO MADE THE CHANGE TO THE FORMFILE NAMES.    *
      *             CHANGED ALL REFERENCES OF TSCRPRNT TO TSCRPRT2,*
      *             TDATECHK TO TDATECK2.                          *
      *             THIS WAS TO INCORPORATE THE NATIVE LANGUAGE    *
      *             SUPPORT VERSIONS OF THESE SUBROUTINES.         *
      *                                           PD RAGLOW.       *
      *                                                            *
      *   07/15/1996    CA YODER                                   *
      *     RE-COMPILED TO PICK UP CENTURY DATABASE CHANGES.       *
      *                                                            *
      *   07/18/2001    CA YODER                                   *
      *     CHANGED DISPLAY FILE TO USE DISPLAY-ONLY VERSION OF    *
      *     SCREEN SO THAT DPOITEM CANNOT BE UPDATED THROUGH THIS  *
      *     PROGRAM.                                               *
      *                                                            *
      *   06/03/2003    CA YODER    TOPEKA REQUEST                 *
      *     CHANGED PROGRAM TO READ MPLTINFO FIELD (KEY=PODL)      *
      *     TO DETERMINE IF SCREEN ALLOWS ADJUSTMENTS OR IS FOR    *
      *     INQUIRY ONLY.                                          *
      *                                                            *
      *   08/23/2004    CA YODER                                   *
      *   COPIED FROM TPAIDADJ AND MODIFIED TO OPEN FILES FOR      *
      *   INPUT ONLY.  ALSO COMMENTED OUT LOGIC TO UPDATE DPOITEM  *
      *   AND DDAILYTC.                                            *
      *                                                            *
      **************************************************************


       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER.  IBM-AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.  IBM-AS400.
       SPECIAL-NAMES.    I-O-FEEDBACK IS I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA.

       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT DISPLAY-FILE
                  ASSIGN TO WORKSTATION-ZPAIDADJ-SI
                  ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
                  ACCESS IS DYNAMIC
                  RELATIVE KEY IS RELATIVE-RECNO
                  FILE STATUS IS DISPLAY-STATUS
                  CONTROL-AREA IS WS-CONTROL.
           SELECT MPLTINFO-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0501
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
           SELECT DPORECD-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0901
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                    WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
           SELECT DPOITEM-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS1002
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                    WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
      ***  SELECT DPOITEM-O
      ***         ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS1002
      ***         ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
      ***           ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
      ***         RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
      ***           WITH DUPLICATES
      ***         FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
      ***  SELECT DDAILYTC-O
      ***         ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS1601
      ***         ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
      ***           ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
      ***         RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
      ***           WITH DUPLICATES
      ***         FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.


       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  DISPLAY-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED.
       01  DISPLAY-REC           PIC X(2000).
       FD  MPLTINFO-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MPLTINFO-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLCS0501.
       FD  DPORECD-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DPORECD-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLCS0901.
       FD  DPOITEM-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DPOITEM-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLCS1002.
      *FD  DPOITEM-O
      *    LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
      *01  DPOITEM-REC-O.
      *    COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLCS1002.
      *FD  DDAILYTC-O
      *    LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
      *01  DDAILYTC-REC-O.
      *    COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLCS1601.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       77  COMP-SCREEN-INDIC       PIC X(3)    VALUE SPACES.
       77  UPDATES-ALLOWED-SW      PIC X       VALUE "N".
       01  SAVE-ADJUST-QTY         PIC S9(8)V9(4)   VALUE ZEROS.
       01  PAID-QTY-COMPARE        PIC S9(9)V9(4)   VALUE ZEROS.
       01  FILE-STATUS.
           05  FILE-STATUS-1       PIC X            VALUE SPACES.
           05  FILE-STATUS-2       PIC X            VALUE SPACES.
       01  RELATIVE-RECNO          PIC 9(9).
      **********************
      *                    *
      *  S W I T C H E S   *
      *                    *
      **********************

       01  SWITCH-AREA.
           05  FATAL-ERR-SW            PIC X       VALUE "N".
           05  EOJ-SW                  PIC X       VALUE "N".


       01  BUILD-PO-NUM.
           05  FILLER                  PIC X    VALUE "P".
           05  PO-NUM                  PIC X(7) VALUE SPACES.
           05  PO-RLSE                 PIC X(3) VALUE "000".
           05  PO-RCV                  PIC X(3) VALUE "000".

       COPY VCOMAREA IN COPYLIB.

       01  FORMFILE.
           05  FORM-FNAME                PIC X(8)  VALUE "FPAIDADJ".
           05  FILLER                    PIC X     VALUE ".".
           05  FORM-GNAME.
               10  FORM-GNAME1           PIC X(5)  VALUE "FLANG".
               10  FORM-GNAME2           PIC X(3)  VALUE SPACES.
           05  FILLER                    PIC X(19) VALUE SPACES.

       01  COMMAND-AREA.
           05  OVERRIDE-ZPAIDADJ      PIC X(34) VALUE
               "OVRDSPF FILE(ZPAIDADJ) SHARE(*YES)".
           05  OVERRIDE-PARM2         PIC S9(10)V9(5) COMP-3 VALUE 34.

       01  SAVE-VIEW-STATUS          PIC S9(4) COMP-4 VALUE ZEROS.

       01  MESSAGE-BUFFER.
           05  MSG-TEXT              PIC X(64)    VALUE SPACE.
           05  MSG-FLD               PIC X(12)    VALUE SPACE.
           05  MSG-FLD-9  REDEFINES  MSG-FLD      PIC Z(11)9.

       01  MESSAGE-BUFLEN            PIC S9(4)    VALUE 76    COMP-4.

       01  MESSAGE-ACTLEN            PIC S9(4)    VALUE ZERO  COMP-4.

       01  FIELD-NUMBER              PIC S9(4)    VALUE 1     COMP-4.


       01  PASSED-SPOOL-PRT          PIC S9(2)    VALUE ZEROS COMP-4.

      **************************************************************
      **************************************************************
      **                                                          **
      **             TERMINAL I/O DATA AREA                       **
      **                                                          **
      **************************************************************
      **************************************************************

       01  SCREEN-1.
           05  S1-COMPANY                  PIC X(3).
           05  S1-PO-NUM                   PIC X(7).
           05  S1-PO-REL                   PIC X(3).
           05  S1-CMDLINE                  PIC X(79).
           05  S1-MSGLINE                  PIC X(79).

       01  SUBFILE-CONTROL.
           05  SC-COMPANY                  PIC X(3).
           05  SC-PO-NUM                   PIC X(7).
           05  SC-PO-REL                   PIC X(3).

       01  DISP-SUBFILE.
           05  DS-ITEM-INFO.
               10 DS-ITEM-TABLE.
                   15  DS-ITEM-NO          PIC 9999.
                   15  DS-CODE             PIC X(7).
                   15  DS-QTY-ORDERED      PIC ZZZZZZZ9.9(4).
                   15  DS-QTY-RCVD         PIC ZZZZZZZ9.9(4).
                   15  DS-QTY-PAID         PIC ZZZZZZZ9.9(4).
                   15  DS-UM               PIC XX.
                   15  DS-ADJUST-QTY       PIC 9(8)V9(4).
                   15  DS-ADJUST-SIGN      PIC X.


      **************************************************************
      **************************************************************
      **                                                          **
      **                DATABASE I/O BUFFER AREA                  **
      **                                                          **
      **************************************************************
      **************************************************************


       COPY DPOITEM    IN COPYLIB.

       COPY MPLTINFO   IN COPYLIB.

       COPY DPORECD    IN COPYLIB.

       COPY DDAILYTC   IN COPYLIB.

       COPY TC493      IN COPYLIB.

      *********************
      *                   *
      *   DATA SET NAMES  *
      *                   *
      *********************

       01  DSET-NAMES.
           05  DSET-NAME              PIC X(16)  VALUE SPACES.
           05  DSET-DPOITEM           PIC X(16)  VALUE "DPOITEM;".
           05  DSET-MPLTINFO          PIC X(16)  VALUE "MPLTINFO;".
           05  DSET-DPORECD           PIC X(16)  VALUE "DPORECD;".
           05  DSET-DDAILYTC          PIC X(16)  VALUE "DDAILYTC;".

       COPY DATAB      IN COPYLIB.

       01 ITEMS-LISTING.
           05  ALL-ITEMS              PIC XX    VALUE "@;".
           05  PO-SEARCH              PIC X(10) VALUE "PO-RCV-NO;".

       01 ARG-VALUES.
           05  PLT-ARG                PIC X(4)  VALUE SPACES.
           05  PO-ARG                 PIC X(14) VALUE SPACES.

       01  DATES-AND-TIMES.
           05  CUR-DATE.
               10  YY               PIC XX.
               10  MM               PIC XX.
               10  DD               PIC XX.

       COPY TDATECHK   IN COPYLIB.

       COPY TBLOWUP    IN COPYLIB.

       COPY LANGUAGE   IN COPYLIB.

       COPY DISPDATA IN COPYLIB.
       COPY IOFEEDBACK IN COPYLIB.
       COPY CATREAD  IN COPYLIB.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.

       PROC-DIV SECTION 01.

       BEGIN-HERE.
           PERFORM 1-HSK THRU 1-H-X.

           PERFORM 6-MAIN THRU 6-M-X.

           PERFORM 2-EOJ  THRU 2-EOJ-X.

           GOBACK.

       1-HSK.
           MOVE "TPAIDADJ"  TO  BU-PGM-NAME.
           CALL "QCMDEXC" USING OVERRIDE-ZPAIDADJ, OVERRIDE-PARM2.
           OPEN I-O DISPLAY-FILE.

           OPEN INPUT MPLTINFO-I, DPORECD-I, DPOITEM-I.
      ***  OPEN I-O   DPOITEM-O.
      ***  OPEN OUTPUT DDAILYTC-O.

      *-------- ARE UPDATES ALLOWED AT THIS PLANT?
      *-------- WITH THIS VERSION OF THE PROGRAM, NO.
           MOVE "N"                        TO  UPDATES-ALLOWED-SW.
      ***  MOVE "PODL"  TO  PLT-ARG.
      ***  MOVE PLT-ARG TO  PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-REC-I.
      ***  READ MPLTINFO-I INTO BUF-MPLTINFO
      ***      INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
      ***  IF FILE-STATUS = "00"
      ***      IF MPLTINFO-UPD-AP9 > " "
      ***          MOVE MPLTINFO-UPD-AP9   TO  UPDATES-ALLOWED-SW.

      **************************************************
      *                                                *
      *   GET CO. AND PRIME FROM MPLTINFO              *
      *   USING 'P 01' AS THE ARGUMENT                 *
      *                                                *
      **************************************************

           MOVE "P 01"  TO  PLT-ARG.
           MOVE PLT-ARG TO  PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-REC-I.
           READ MPLTINFO-I INTO BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "READ MPLTINFO 1-HSK P 01"  TO  BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               MOVE PLT-ARG               TO  BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2)
               GO TO 2-BLOWUP.
           MOVE MPLTINFO-COMPANY            TO  COMP-SCREEN-INDIC.
           ACCEPT CUR-DATE  FROM  DATE.

       1-H-X.
           EXIT.

       2-EOJ.
           CLOSE MPLTINFO-I, DPORECD-I, DPOITEM-I,
                                        DISPLAY-FILE.
      ********** DPOITEM-O, DDAILYTC-O, DISPLAY-FILE.

       2-EOJ-X.
            EXIT.

      ******************************************************
      **                                                  **
      **   BLOWUP ROUTINE                                 **
      **                                                  **
      ******************************************************

       2-BLOWUP.
           MOVE "TPAIDADJ"              TO  BU-PGM-NAME.
           CALL "TBLOWUP" USING BASE, BU-PGM-NAME, STATUS-AREA,
               VIEW-COMAREA, FILE-STATUS, BU-DISPLAY-MSG,
                       BU-DISPLAY-FLDS.

       2-BLOWUP-X.
           EXIT.



       4-PGM-ERROR.
           MOVE B"1" TO IND(99), IND(FIELD-NUMBER).
           MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO S1-MSGLINE.

       4-PGM-ERROR-X.
           EXIT.

      **************************************************
      *                                                *
      *     6 - M A I N                                *
      *                                                *
      **************************************************

       6-MAIN.
           MOVE "PAIDADJ1"  TO  VIEW-NFNAME.

       6-PUT-BUFFER-1.
           MOVE SPACES             TO  SCREEN-1.
           MOVE ZEROS              TO  S1-PO-REL.
           MOVE COMP-SCREEN-INDIC  TO  S1-COMPANY.

       6-SHOWFORM-SCREEN-1.
           MOVE SCREEN-1           TO  DISPLAY-REC.
           PERFORM 998-WRITE-SCREEN THRU 998-READ-SCREEN.
           MOVE DISPLAY-REC        TO  SCREEN-1.

       6-READ-SCREEN-1.
           IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 3
               GO TO 6-M-X
           ELSE
           IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 1 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 2 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 4 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 5 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 6 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 7 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 8
      *        *** INVALID FUNCTION KEY ENTERED ***
               MOVE   9 TO LANG-SETNUM
               MOVE  10 TO LANG-MSGNUM
               PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
               MOVE 1  TO  FIELD-NUMBER
               PERFORM 4-PGM-ERROR  THRU  4-PGM-ERROR-X
               GO TO 6-SHOWFORM-SCREEN-1.

      *****************************************************
      *                                                   *
      *    EDIT PURCHASE ORDER NUMBER                     *
      *                                                   *
      *****************************************************

       6-EDIT-PO-ENTRY.
           MOVE S1-PO-NUM               TO  PO-NUM.
           MOVE S1-PO-REL               TO  PO-RLSE.
           MOVE BUILD-PO-NUM            TO  PO-ARG,
                                            BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1).
           MOVE PO-ARG TO PORCVNO OF DPORECD-REC-I.
           START DPORECD-I KEY = PORCVNO OF DPORECD-REC-I
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
      *            *** PURCHASE ORDER DOES NOT EXIST ***
                   MOVE  16 TO LANG-SETNUM
                   MOVE  45 TO LANG-MSGNUM
                   PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
                   MOVE 1  TO  FIELD-NUMBER
                   PERFORM 4-PGM-ERROR  THRU  4-PGM-ERROR-X
                   GO TO 6-SHOWFORM-SCREEN-1
               ELSE
                   MOVE "START DPORECD 6-ERO" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                   GO TO 2-BLOWUP.

           READ DPORECD-I NEXT INTO BUF-DPORECD
               AT END MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "GET DPORECD 6-EPE" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               GO TO 2-BLOWUP.

           MOVE PO-ARG TO PORCVNO OF DPOITEM-REC-I.
           START DPOITEM-I KEY = PORCVNO OF DPOITEM-REC-I
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
                 MOVE "* NO ITEMS WERE FOUND ON THIS P.O. *"
                     TO  BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                 MOVE 1  TO FIELD-NUMBER
                 PERFORM 4-PGM-ERROR  THRU  4-PGM-ERROR-X
                 GO TO 6-SHOWFORM-SCREEN-1
               ELSE
                 MOVE "FIND DPOITEM * 6-EPE" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                 GO TO 2-BLOWUP.

           MOVE SPACES     TO  SUBFILE-CONTROL.
           MOVE COMP-SCREEN-INDIC TO SC-COMPANY.
           MOVE PO-NUM     TO  SC-PO-NUM.
           MOVE PO-RLSE    TO  SC-PO-REL.
           PERFORM 810-CLEAR-SUBFILE THRU 810-EXIT.
           MOVE 0          TO RELATIVE-RECNO.


       6-LOAD-ITEM-INFO.
           PERFORM 61-GET-ITEMS          THRU  61-GI-X.
           PERFORM 62-PROCESS-ITEM-INFO  THRU  62-PII-X.
           GO TO 6-MAIN.

       6-M-X.
           EXIT.

       61-GET-ITEMS.
           READ DPOITEM-I NEXT INTO BUF-DPOITEM
               AT END MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STATUS = "10" OR "14" OR "46"
                   GO TO 61-GI-X
               ELSE
                   MOVE "GET DPOITEM 61-GI" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                   GO TO 2-BLOWUP.
           IF PORCVNO OF DPOITEM-REC-I NOT = PO-ARG
               GO TO 61-GI-X.

           MOVE SPACES            TO  DISP-SUBFILE.
           IF UPDATES-ALLOWED-SW = "Y"
               MOVE B"1" TO IND(52).
           MOVE ITM-NUMBER        TO  DS-ITEM-NO.
           MOVE ITM-CORP-CODE     TO  DS-CODE.
           MOVE ITM-QTY-ORD       TO  DS-QTY-ORDERED.
           MOVE ITM-QTY-DLVR      TO  DS-QTY-RCVD.
           MOVE ITM-QTY-PAID      TO  DS-QTY-PAID.
           MOVE ITM-UM            TO  DS-UM.
           MOVE ZEROS             TO  DS-ADJUST-QTY.
           MOVE "-"               TO  DS-ADJUST-SIGN.
           MOVE DISP-SUBFILE      TO  DISPLAY-REC.
           ADD 1 TO RELATIVE-RECNO.
           WRITE SUBFILE DISPLAY-REC FORMAT "RDSF"
                 INDICATORS SRF-INDICATORS.

           GO TO 61-GET-ITEMS.

       61-GI-X.
           EXIT.


       62-PROCESS-ITEM-INFO.
           WRITE DISPLAY-REC FORMAT "RDSB"
                 INDICATORS SRF-INDICATORS.

       62-DISPLAY-SUBFILE.
           MOVE B"1" TO IND(76).
           IF RELATIVE-RECNO > ZERO
               MOVE B"1" TO IND(75)
           ELSE
               MOVE B"0" TO IND(75).
           IF UPDATES-ALLOWED-SW = "Y"
               MOVE B"1" TO IND(52).
           MOVE SUBFILE-CONTROL TO DISPLAY-REC.
           WRITE DISPLAY-REC FORMAT "RDSC" INDICATORS SRF-INDICATORS.
           READ DISPLAY-FILE FORMAT "RDSC" INDICATORS SRF-INDICATORS.

       62-UPDATE-LOOP.
           READ SUBFILE DISPLAY-FILE NEXT MODIFIED RECORD
                FORMAT "RDSF" INDICATORS SRF-INDICATORS
                AT END GO TO 62-PII-X.
           IF DISPLAY-STATUS NOT = "00"
                GO TO 62-PII-X.
           MOVE DISPLAY-REC TO DISP-SUBFILE.
      ***  IF DS-ADJUST-QTY > ZEROS
      ***      IF DS-ADJUST-SIGN  = "-" OR = "+"
      ***          GO TO 62-UPDATE-ITEMS
      ***      ELSE
      *         *** '+' OR '-' REQUIRED
      ***          MOVE B"1" TO IND(78), IND(51)
      ***          GO TO 62-DISPLAY-SUBFILE
      ***  ELSE
               GO TO 62-UPDATE-LOOP.

      *62-UPDATE-ITEMS.
      ***  MOVE PO-ARG           TO  PORCVNO OF DPOITEM-REC-O.
      ***  MOVE DS-ITEM-NO       TO  ITEMNO  OF DPOITEM-REC-O.
      ***  READ DPOITEM-O INTO BUF-DPOITEM
      ***      INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
      *    IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
      *        MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD
      *    ELSE
      ***  IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
      ***      MOVE "GET DPOITEM *62-UL" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
      ***      GO TO 2-BLOWUP.
      ***
      ***  IF DS-ADJUST-SIGN = "-"
      ***     IF DS-ADJUST-QTY > ITM-QTY-PAID
      *            *** CANNOT REDUCE QUANTITY PAID BELOW ZERO ***
      ***         MOVE B"1" TO IND(78), IND(50)
      *------- DO A START > HIGH-VALUES TO UNLOCK
      ***         MOVE HIGH-VALUES TO PORCVNO OF DPOITEM-REC-O
      ***         START DPOITEM-O KEY > PORCVNO OF DPOITEM-REC-O
      ***            INVALID KEY MOVE "00" TO FILE-STATUS
      ***         END-START
      ***         GO TO 62-DISPLAY-SUBFILE.
      ***
      ***  IF DS-ADJUST-SIGN = "-"
      ***      MULTIPLY DS-ADJUST-QTY BY -1
      ***         GIVING SAVE-ADJUST-QTY
      ***  ELSE
      ***      MOVE DS-ADJUST-QTY TO SAVE-ADJUST-QTY.
      ***  ADD SAVE-ADJUST-QTY  TO  ITM-QTY-PAID
      ***  IF ITM-QTY-PAID < ZERO
      ***      MOVE ZEROS  TO  ITM-QTY-PAID.
      ***
      ***  REWRITE DPOITEM-REC-O FROM BUF-DPOITEM
      ***      INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
      ***  IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
      ***      MOVE "UPDATE DPOITEM * 62-UL" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
      ***      GO TO 2-BLOWUP.
      ***
      ***  CALL "TDATECHK" USING DATE-CHECK-AREA.
      ***  MOVE SPACES                   TO  BUF-DDAILYTC.
      ***  MOVE DATE-YMD-OUT             TO  DDAILYTC-DATE.
      ***  MOVE DATE-UNFORMATTED-TIME-OUT TO DDAILYTC-TIME.
      ***  MOVE "493"                    TO  DDAILYTC-TC.
      ***  MOVE MPLTINFO-COMPANY         TO  DDAILYTC-PLT.
      ***  MOVE ITM-CORP-CODE            TO  TC493-CORP-CODE.
      ***  MOVE ITM-NUMBER               TO  TC493-ITEM-NO.
      ***  MOVE ITM-UM                   TO  TC493-ITEM-QTY-UM.
      ***  MOVE ITM-PO-NO-AND-REL        TO  TC493-PO-NO.
      ***  MOVE SAVE-ADJUST-QTY          TO  TC493-ADJ-QTY.
      ***  MOVE ITM-CLASS                TO  TC493-SUB.
      ***  MOVE ITM-SUB-DETL             TO  TC493-SUBD.
      ***  MOVE ITM-ADDL-DATA            TO  TC493-ADDTL-DATA.
      ***  WRITE DDAILYTC-REC-O FROM BUF-DDAILYTC
      ***      INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
      ***  IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
      ***      MOVE "PUT DDAILYTC * 62-UL" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
      ***      GO TO 2-BLOWUP.
      ***
      ***  MOVE "-"                      TO  DS-ADJUST-SIGN.
      ***  MOVE ITM-QTY-PAID             TO  DS-QTY-PAID.
      ***  MOVE ZEROS                    TO  DS-ADJUST-QTY.
      ***  MOVE DISP-SUBFILE             TO  DISPLAY-REC.
      ***  REWRITE SUBFILE DISPLAY-REC FORMAT "RDSF"
      ***     INDICATORS SRF-INDICATORS.
      ***
      ***  GO TO 62-UPDATE-LOOP.

       62-PII-X.
           EXIT.

       810-CLEAR-SUBFILE.
           MOVE B"0" TO IND(75), IND(76).
           MOVE B"1" TO IND(77).
           MOVE SUBFILE-CONTROL TO DISPLAY-REC.
           WRITE DISPLAY-REC FORMAT "RDSC" INDICATORS SRF-INDICATORS.
           MOVE B"0" TO IND(77).
           MOVE ZERO TO RELATIVE-RECNO.

       810-EXIT.
           EXIT.

       999-CATREAD.
           IF CATREAD-MSG-NUMBER = ZEROS
               MOVE LANG-SETNUM TO CATREAD-MSG-SET
               MOVE LANG-MSGNUM TO CATREAD-MSG-NUM.
           CALL "CCATREAD" USING CATREAD-PARMS.
           MOVE CATREAD-MSG-TEXT TO MESSAGE-BUFFER.
       999-CATREAD-EXIT.
           EXIT.
       COPY DISPCALL IN COPYLIB.
